{"seq":1,"slug":"minimap-performance","title":"性能与更新率：把小地图的帧成本压下来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-minimap-systems/practice/minimap-performance","wordCount":1712,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能与更新率-把小地图的帧成本压下来\">性能与更新率：把小地图的帧成本压下来</h1><p>小地图是屏幕上最不起眼的一块，却能悄悄吃掉一台移动设备好几毫秒的帧时间——一台每帧全量渲染的副摄像机、一堆每帧重建的 blip、一张每帧重画的探索遮罩，叠起来足以让 60 帧掉到 45。这一篇是把前面所有渲染与标记决策落进帧预算的收官账本：副相机的真实成本、更新率如何与渲染解耦、批处理与剔除、以及移动端的额外约束。它把 <a href=\"../rendering/render-approaches\">渲染方式</a> 里点到的成本逐项量化并给出压制手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-小地图的三大成本来源\">核心概念：小地图的三大成本来源</h2><p>小地图的帧成本集中在三处，优化前先定位瓶颈在哪：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[小地图每帧成本] --&gt; B[底图生成]&#10;  A --&gt; C[标记更新]&#10;  A --&gt; D[探索/迷雾合成]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[副相机: 一次场景渲染]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[预烘焙: 近乎零]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[blip 收集+坐标变换+绘制]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[遮罩采样+可能的位图更新]&#10;  B1 --&gt; E[优化: 降更新率/窄剔除/低分辨率RT]&#10;  C1 --&gt; F[优化: 空间分区/合批/对象池]&#10;  D1 --&gt; G[优化: 低分辨率位图/增量更新]\">flowchart TD\n  A[小地图每帧成本] --&gt; B[底图生成]\n  A --&gt; C[标记更新]\n  A --&gt; D[探索/迷雾合成]\n  B --&gt; B1[副相机: 一次场景渲染]\n  B --&gt; B2[预烘焙: 近乎零]\n  C --&gt; C1[blip 收集+坐标变换+绘制]\n  D --&gt; D1[遮罩采样+可能的位图更新]\n  B1 --&gt; E[优化: 降更新率/窄剔除/低分辨率RT]\n  C1 --&gt; F[优化: 空间分区/合批/对象池]\n  D1 --&gt; G[优化: 低分辨率位图/增量更新]</pre><p>三处成本的量级差异极大：副相机方案的底图生成往往是最大头，预烘焙方案则几乎为零、瓶颈转到标记。所以优化的第一步永远是先按渲染路线判断主成本在哪，别在小头上花力气。</p>\n<h2 id=\"更新率解耦-小地图不需要每帧刷新\">更新率解耦：小地图不需要每帧刷新</h2><p>最重要、性价比最高的一条优化：<strong>小地图的更新率可以远低于游戏帧率</strong>。玩家在余光里瞟一眼小地图，根本分辨不出它是每帧刷新还是每 100 毫秒刷新一次。把小地图更新从渲染循环解耦，独立按一个较低频率（如 10–15 Hz）刷新，就能把副相机渲染、blip 重建、遮罩合成的成本直接除以数倍。</p>\n<p>设游戏帧率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、小地图更新率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则小地图相关成本被摊薄的比例约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_m / f_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_g = 60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_m = 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span>，副相机只需每 5 帧渲染一次，其平均成本降到原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/5</span></span></span></span></span>。实现上用一个累加计时器控制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>当 </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mfrac><mtext> 时刷新并重置 </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{当 } t_{acc} \\ge \\frac{1}{f_m} \\text{ 时刷新并重置 } t_{acc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时刷新并重置</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>要注意两点。其一，<strong>玩家自身标记应例外</strong>——玩家箭头的位置和朝向最好仍每帧更新（用轻量的纯 UI 变换，不重渲染底图），否则玩家会觉得自己的点在卡顿。其二，<strong>位置插值</strong>：底图低频更新会让快速移动的敌方 blip 显得跳跃，可对 blip 位置做帧间插值平滑掉台阶感。哪些字段高频、哪些低频，回到 <a href=\"../foundations/minimap-model\">小地图数据模型</a> 的推/拉划分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"副摄像机的成本压制\">副摄像机的成本压制</h2><p>若走副相机路线，这台相机是主要开销，四条压制手段按收益排序：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>降更新率</strong>（上一节）——最大收益，直接除以倍数。</li>\n<li><strong>窄剔除掩码（culling mask）</strong>——让小地图相机只渲染必要图层（地形+标记层），跳过角色蒙皮、粒子、后处理。一个只渲染低模地形和 blip 的相机，比全量渲染便宜一个数量级。</li>\n<li><strong>低分辨率 RenderTexture</strong>——RT 分辨率只需匹配显示尺寸，256×256 贴到 200 像素控件绰绰有余，别用 1024。</li>\n<li><strong>简化渲染路径</strong>——在 HDRP/延迟管线下给小地图相机单独配前向/无光照路径，避免拖上整套 GBuffer 与光照（社区在 <a href=\"https://forum.unity.com/threads/best-practices-for-hdrp-minimaps.1016722/\">HDRP 小地图讨论</a> 反复强调这点）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>下表把三条渲染路线的性能画像并列，指导选型时的成本预判：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渲染路线</th>\n<th>主成本</th>\n<th>每帧固定开销</th>\n<th>优化重心</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>副摄像机</td>\n<td>场景重渲染</td>\n<td>高（一次渲染）</td>\n<td>降更新率+窄剔除+低 RT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预烘焙纹理</td>\n<td>几乎无</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>标记层与遮罩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矢量绘制</td>\n<td>几何绘制</td>\n<td>中（随图元数）</td>\n<td>缓存静态几何+合批</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"标记层的批处理与剔除\">标记层的批处理与剔除</h2><p>预烘焙路线下瓶颈转到标记。核心手段前一篇已埋下伏笔，这里落到性能视角：</p>\n<p><strong>合批（batching）</strong>——所有 blip 用同一张图标图集、同一材质绘制，合成一个 draw call（见 <a href=\"../markers/markers-icons\">标记与图标</a>）。打断合批的元凶是换纹理和换材质，因此动态状态要用 UV/顶点色而非换图。UI draw call 的合批规则与通用 UI 一致，深入见跨库性能文档。</p>\n<p><strong>剔除（culling）</strong>——只处理会显示的 blip。上游数据模型用空间分区（网格哈希/四叉树）把「玩家周边 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 内的实体」查询压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，避免每帧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 全扫世界实体。超出可视范围的转交离屏指示或直接丢弃，不参与绘制。</p>\n<p><strong>对象池（pooling）</strong>——blip 图标频繁生成销毁会触发 GC，在托管内存环境（C#）尤其致命，一次 GC 卡顿足以掉帧。预分配一个 blip 图标池、复用而非新建，是移动端的必备实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"探索遮罩与移动端约束\">探索遮罩与移动端约束</h2><p>探索/迷雾合成（见 <a href=\"../markers/fog-exploration\">迷雾与探索揭示</a>）的成本主要在遮罩纹理。两条优化：<strong>低分辨率位图</strong>——探索位图分辨率远低于底图（一块几米对应一像素足矣），大幅省内存与采样带宽；<strong>增量更新</strong>——揭示写入只更新变化的区域，而非每帧重建整张位图，配合脏矩形（dirty rect）只上传改动部分。</p>\n<p>移动端有几条额外硬约束值得单列。<strong>带宽敏感</strong>：移动 GPU 是 tile-based 架构，多一张 RenderTexture 就多一次 tile 内存往返，副相机方案在移动端代价被放大，很多手游因此转向预烘焙。<strong>发热与降频</strong>：小地图这种「一直在跑」的常驻开销会持续产热，长会话下触发降频反而拖累全局，因此常驻成本要格外抠。<strong>内存</strong>：图集、底图瓦片、探索位图都占显存，开放世界要配合地形流送按需加载/卸载底图瓦片。这些约束会在 <a href=\"minimap-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 的平台适配里进一步展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>优化第一步是<strong>按渲染路线定位主成本</strong>：副相机主成本在底图重渲染，预烘焙主成本转到标记层。</li>\n<li>性价比最高的优化是<strong>更新率解耦</strong>——小地图按 10–15 Hz 独立刷新，成本摊薄为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_m/f_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，但玩家自身标记每帧更新、其余 blip 帧间插值。</li>\n<li>副相机靠<strong>降更新率+窄剔除掩码+低分辨率 RT+简化渲染路径</strong>压制；标记层靠<strong>图集合批+空间分区剔除+对象池</strong>。</li>\n<li>探索遮罩用<strong>低分辨率位图+增量脏矩形更新</strong>；移动端受 tile 带宽、发热降频、显存三重约束，常倒逼预烘焙。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>各渲染路线的成本来源见 <a href=\"../rendering/render-approaches\">渲染方式</a>；标记合批的实现见 <a href=\"../markers/markers-icons\">标记与图标</a>。</li>\n<li>更新率的推/拉字段划分见 <a href=\"../foundations/minimap-model\">小地图数据模型</a>；探索位图见 <a href=\"../markers/fog-exploration\">迷雾与探索揭示</a>。</li>\n<li>平台适配与集成落地见 <a href=\"minimap-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库：UI draw call 合批、tile-based GPU 带宽优化的通用原理见 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/draw-calls-batching\">游戏性能优化 · Draw Call 与批处理</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能与更新率：把小地图的帧成本压下来","id":"性能与更新率-把小地图的帧成本压下来"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：小地图的三大成本来源","id":"核心概念-小地图的三大成本来源"},{"level":2,"text":"更新率解耦：小地图不需要每帧刷新","id":"更新率解耦-小地图不需要每帧刷新"},{"level":2,"text":"副摄像机的成本压制","id":"副摄像机的成本压制"},{"level":2,"text":"标记层的批处理与剔除","id":"标记层的批处理与剔除"},{"level":2,"text":"探索遮罩与移动端约束","id":"探索遮罩与移动端约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"迷雾与探索揭示：探索状态在小地图上的呈现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-minimap-systems/markers/fog-exploration"},"next":{"title":"可读性与无障碍：让所有人都能读懂小地图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-minimap-systems/practice/minimap-accessibility"}}